177: * agent process itself was launched from (git hooks, `git --git-dir` wrappers),
178: * so forwarding them to a child shell makes `git` ignore the command's `cwd`
179: * and mutate the wrong worktree or index. Stripped from child shell envs so git
180: * rediscovers the repository from the working directory. Mirrors the
181: * `env_remove` list in `crates/pi-vcs/src/git/cli.rs`.
182: */
183:const GIT_REPO_LOCATION_ENV_NAMES = [
184:	"GIT_DIR",
185:	"GIT_COMMON_DIR",
186:	"GIT_WORK_TREE",
